Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（声音）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[SOUND]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不是虚无之神，不是世界的切割者。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I am no god of the void, slicer of worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}很久以前，当光明侵入我的王国，\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Long ago, when light invaded my kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的共生孩子背叛了我，把我囚禁在这里。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}my symbiote children betrayed me and imprisoned me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}最后，一个法典被创造出来了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}At last a codex is being created.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我获得自由的钥匙。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It is the key to my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.39,0:01:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}它会打开这个监狱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It will unlock this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我命令你走遍宇宙的各个角落直到找到这把钥匙。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I order you to search the corners of the universe until you find this key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}给我找抄本。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Find me the codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}等我逃出去，消灭所有的生命星球，然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And when I escape and annihilate every living planet and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.33,0:02:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}摧毁我的共生后代，我就用你们的命来回报你们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}destroy my symbiote offspring, I will reward you with your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}所以你是说在这个宇宙里有超级英雄。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So you're saying in this universe there's the superhero people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗨，再跟我说说你的紫色外星人朋友他真的很喜欢石头。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hi, so tell me again about your purple alien friend who really loves stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我告诉你吧，外星人不喜欢石头。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'll tell you what, man, aliens, they do not love stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们没有开始。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不要爱石头。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Do not love stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你知道他们喜欢什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Do you know what they love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们喜欢吃大脑，因为那是他们的工作。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They love eating brains because that's what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.32,0:03:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}Señor，他让我的家人消失了五年。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Señor, he made my family disappear for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}五年。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看，那是一段很长的时间。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}See, that is a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们喝醉了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（声音）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[SOUND]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们回家。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:04:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我受够了多元宇宙的破事我更喜欢我们的酒保。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm so done with the multiverse shit that I like our version of the barman better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我头疼。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我觉得我喝醉了，但同时我也宿醉了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I feel like I'm drunk, but I'm also hungover at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你想要一个该死的码头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You want a bloody marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不想喝酒。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I don't want to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}怎么，臭牛奶。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Why, gross milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你在毁掉这个人的酒吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You are destroying this man's bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我今天过得很开心。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm having a time of my life today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我宁愿要一杯水。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'd rather have a glass of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}像个男人，埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Be a man, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.07,0:04:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们应该去当酒保。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We should have been a bartender.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}龙舌兰酒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Tequila!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我做到了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.78,0:04:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我做到了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}先生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Señor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那些东西到底是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What the hell were those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.92,0:04:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我生来就有。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I was born with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}该死的酒吧，我受够了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Freaking bar, I'm done with this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}Kelly Roulet在旧金山报道。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is Kelly Roulet reporting from San Francisco.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}警方仍在努力寻找前记者埃迪·布洛克，并对其进行讯问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Police are still trying to locate former reporter Eddie Brock for questioning after.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}帕特里克·穆里根警探的惨死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}the tragic death of Detective Patrick Mulligan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}穆里根警探是在佩尔被发现的，那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Detective Mulligan was found in Pail and that's a.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}在这座城市的大教堂里发生了一系列奇怪的事件。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}series of bizarre happenings at the city's cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们认为是我杀了他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They think that I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他能逃避当局多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}How long can he evade authorities?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只有时间会告诉我们答案。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Only time will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}如果我们上了这里的新闻，我们就上了所有地方的新闻。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}If we are on the news here, we are on the news everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们不能回旧金山，我也不会待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We can't go back to San Francisco and I'm not staying down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}在墨西哥躲一辈子，这是肯定的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}here hiding for the rest of my life in Mexico, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Where will we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不知道。我不知道。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I don't know. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是可行的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这个教堂害我被赶出了纽约。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This church got me kicked out of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}真是个混蛋。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我手上还有一堆他的把柄。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I still got a ton of shit on him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.10,0:06:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我一直想去看看自由女神像。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I've always wanted to see the Statue of Liberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}也许我们可以勒索他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Maybe we could blackmail him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}还我清白。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Clear my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们走吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.41,0:06:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}公路旅行。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们离开这鬼地方吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.28,0:06:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}找零吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Take the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.54,0:06:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们低着头继续前进。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We keep our heads down and we keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们正在射杀他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are shooting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们在逃亡。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are on the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的，我们陷入了困境。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yes, we are in the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的，但我会吃掉所有妨碍我们的坏人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yes, but I will eat every bad guy that gets in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我需要一个标题。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I need a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是你干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.37,0:07:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}有人有麻烦了，我需要燃料上路。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Someone's in trouble and I need fuel for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的，好的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这样的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}蝙蝠侠，艾迪，我们到底是不是致命守护者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Batman, Eddie, are we the lethal protector or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.68,0:07:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是一个繁忙的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's a busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.24,0:08:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}耶稣。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可爱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我答应过不吃的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I promised not to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们在斗狗。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They're fighting dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}跟狗打架是我的底线，伙计。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I draw the line at fighting dogs, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只有几个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Just a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，你，什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, yo, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.68,0:08:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你来错地方了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，你好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我们的领土。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}从你们威胁的表情来看，我想我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Well, I assume by the threatening look on your faces that I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我应该害怕，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I ought to be scared, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们应该走错路，蝙蝠侠。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We should take the wrong path, Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们可以让你离开。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We can let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我头痛。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I have a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}因为我当时喝了很多酒。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}On account of the fact that I was drinking a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要实话实说。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm going to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我有黑暗和不可预测的一面。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I have a really dark and unpredictable side to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们内心都有恶魔。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We all have monsters inside us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不是这样的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太黑了，它很可能把你的头扯下来喂你的屁眼。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So dark that it is highly likely to tear your head off and feed it to your asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我在这里。你可以喂我。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm here. You can feed it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}对，我可以喂他吃。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah, I can feed it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧，听着。哇，哇，哇。来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All right, look. Whoa, whoa, whoa. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我有个建议。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I got a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不，别说了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No, stop speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不会停止讲话。这是给你的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm not going to stop speaking. This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我这么做是为了你好，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm doing this for your benefit, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.65,0:09:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不需要。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧？只要集中注意力。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay? Just pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们会发现这些狗都很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're going to find all of these dogs loving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}永远的家，因为你的所作所为应该受到谴责。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}forever homes, because what you're doing is reprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你妈妈是怎么看你的，伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And what does your mother think of you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我妈妈死了，科莱罗。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My mother's dead, Colero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你搞得很尴尬。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You made it awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}听到这个消息我很难过。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太好了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}部分原因。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Part of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:09:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我在给你一个机会。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm giving you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}亲爱的，我真的，我在给你一个机会。你也许应该接受它。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Sweetie, I'm really, I'm giving you a chance. You should probably take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看到的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}See.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看到的时候。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}See when.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.03,0:10:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}打电话。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Call the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你好，bitch（婊子）。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hola, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谁是坏男孩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Who's a bad boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我去买一双结实的鞋。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'll get some sturdy footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.34,0:11:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们是来旅游的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们是来旅游的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们是来旅游的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的，我们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah, we.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们是来旅游的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}毒液。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们真的需要在这方面下功夫了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're totally going to need to work on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.11,0:11:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗯，很好吃。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Mmm, that was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不客气。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你带我去所有最好的地方。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You take me to all the finest places.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们离开这鬼地方吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的鞋呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Where's my shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.51,0:12:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿，伙计。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我的鞋。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There's my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我的鞋。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There's my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我的鞋。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There's my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这些合适。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}These will fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}现在我们在为我们确实做过的事奔走。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Now we are on the run for something we actually did do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我被困在了一个不会飞的超级英雄身上。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And I got stuck with the superhero who can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一点点。给你。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}One a bit. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}给我接思特里克兰德将军。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Get me General Strickland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}什么……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}病毒脱落。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Viral shedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这些东西想要生存。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}These things want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hola.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hola.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}跟我说说刚才那个人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Tell me about the man who was just here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他像疯了一样自言自语。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He was acting like crazy talking to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What was he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他的手臂又粗又宽。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He had these big, massive, wide arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.33,0:14:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}它们像这样冒泡。带他来。（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They were bubbling like this. Bring him. [MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你觉得他们是另一颗星星上的兄妹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You think they're another brother and sister on one of those stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看着同一片天空？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Looking at the same sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}总有一天我会告诉你的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'll be able to tell you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的双胞胎兄弟。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My twin brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}未来的NASA科学家。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}A future NASA scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一天。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}当雷声轰鸣时，进入室内。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}When thunder roars, head indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他靠生命维持系统维持生命。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He's on life support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}马上送他去紧急共生中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Get him to emergency symbiosis now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}应该是你。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It should be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们刚刚遇到了一个新闻台，这是值得重复的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They just came across a news desk and it bears repeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}对于你们所有的外星人爱好者来说，这是悲伤的一天。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}For all you alien enthusiasts out there, it's a sad day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.96,0:16:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}华盛顿终于宣布了51区的退役。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Washington has finally announced the decommissioning of Area 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这个有争议的地点因其所谓的外星人试验而闻名。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The controversial site is famous for its alleged testing on aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是今天的其他新闻。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's in other news today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（模糊聊天）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[INDISTINCT CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这边走。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}慢下来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（模糊聊天）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[INDISTINCT CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.33,0:16:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}斯特里克兰。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Strickland.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}斯特里克兰授权。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Strickland authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}[音乐播放]最后发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING] What's finally happening then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的，女士。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yes ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那里只剩下岩石和尘土。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There'll be nothing left but rock and dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}和蟑螂。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}即使是最大的银行也无法消灭它们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Even the biggest of banks couldn't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.95,0:17:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}它们已经存在了大约2.8亿年，而且还在不断增加。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They've been around 280 million years and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不知道佩恩博士。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I did not know that Dr. Payne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.83,0:17:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.33,0:17:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可以走了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}祝你愉快，格斯。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Have a good one Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你也一样。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可以走了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（模糊聊天）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[INDISTINCT CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}早上好，佩恩医生。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Morning Dr. Payne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们会替你保管的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We'll keep them safe for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我还是觉得没人想要我的旧健身馆。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I still don't think anyone wants my old beater gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}现在你想唤起我的h对情侣吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Now would you like to evoke my H-couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}清晨醒来，思特里克兰德将军。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Early morning wake up General Strickland.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看来你所有的梦想都实现了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Looks like all your dreams came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.35,0:18:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我知道你一定很不高兴。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I know how that must bug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他比你早到一会儿。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He arrived shortly before you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们的新朋友给他们添麻烦了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Did our new friend give them any trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你看，这就是问题所在。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You see that's exactly the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你的假设是去见朋友。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Your assumption were meeting friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}早…。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}连接成功了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The bonding was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我听到。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你脸上总是一副可怕的事情即将发生的表情。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You always have this look on your face like something terrible is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}因为在我的工作中，可怕的事情总是迫在眉睫。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Because in my line of work something terrible is always imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们控制住了他们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We contain them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你研究它们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You study them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这就是它的工作原理。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.35,0:19:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}[音乐播放][模糊的闲聊]\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING] [INDISTINCT CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}让我们看一看。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他的另一个共生体离开他等死。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}His other symbiote left him for dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们救了他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他早就死了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我会试着降低这些水平。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'll try lowering those levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}早上赛迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Morning Sadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}让我回去。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let me get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我们在墨西哥拍的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We got this down in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗨。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}受欢迎的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}知道其他人在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Any more on where the rest of them is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.47,0:19:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你有什么消息我们就告诉我。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're getting to update me as you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不明白这种痴迷。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I don't get this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.01,0:19:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我告诉过你这支笔是我妈给我做的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I told you my mom made me this pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是7月。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's July.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.39,0:19:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们在那里见。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'll see you in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这边的每个人都很奇怪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Everyone on this side is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:19:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}别烦她，雷克斯。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Leave her alone Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}上帝不允许任何人真正享受他们的工作。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}God forbid anyone should actually enjoy their work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（门关闭）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（模糊聊天）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[INDISTINCT CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}51区将在本周末完全关闭。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Area 51 will be fully decommissioned by the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}反正这只是一场海难，他们厌倦了游客。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's just a shipwreck anyway and they're tired of the tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们在这里不存在。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We don't exist down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}地下100英尺，人类和非人类都无法察觉。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}100 feet subsurface, undetectable to any human or non-human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.31,0:20:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}每个人都从这里给家里打电话。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Everyone's phoning home from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.60,0:20:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我哥哥最大的抱负就是在51大队做我现在做的事。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My brother's greatest ambition was to work up there at 51 doing what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我希望我能让他看看我们在这里建造的东西。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And I wish I could have shown him what we built down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喘气）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[PANTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.99,0:20:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你是好的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}试着呼吸。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Try to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}当我弟弟和我还是孩子的时候，他们告诉我们不明飞行物只是气象气球。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}When my brother and I were kids they told us that UFOs were just weather balloons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太空垃圾。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Space trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}库布里克在好莱坞的工作室执导了登月。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Kubrick directed the moon landing in a Hollywood studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}很酷的故事。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Cool story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你要去哪里？这第一个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Where are you going? This first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}暴露的风险会增加吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Is there an increased risk of exposure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我担心的不是我们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's not us I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你知道我们携带各种各样的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You know we carry all kinds of viruses and.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可能对敏感生命形式有害的细菌。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}bacteria that could be harmful to a sensitive lifeform.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们不知道我们在处理什么。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And we don't know exactly what we're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只要我们能保证客人的安全就行。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}As long as we're keeping the guests safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我们第一次有一个宿主和我们的共生体相容。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is the first time we've had a host compatible with one of our symbiotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}现在我们可以和一个人说话了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And now we'll be able to talk to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}[音乐播放]自从我们把他绑在一起，他就一直感到恐慌。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING] He's been experiencing panic surges since we've bonded him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}试试jingle bells。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Try jingle bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}所以舒缓。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我怎么没想到呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Well, why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}释放他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Release him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗨。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我是佩恩医生。泰迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm Dr. Payne. Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你在这里很安全。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我会帮你的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm gonna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你们两个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}转移成功了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The transfer was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们别无选择。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们必须试着救你。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We had to try and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}的怪物。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你也坏了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're broken too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（播放音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[MUSIC PLAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.87,0:22:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我可以……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}May I…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我可以问你几个问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}May I ask you some questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.67,0:23:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这个共生体在和你交流吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Is this symbiote communicating with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Do you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}声音使它们苦恼。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Sound distresses them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.31,0:23:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们为什么在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}安全的避风港。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Safe haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.82,0:23:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}避风港？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Safe haven?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们在跑步。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We were running.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他说的是其他共生体吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Is he talking about the other symbiotes?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我想是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.33,0:23:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他的造物在宇宙中寻找我们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}His creatures search the universe for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们会没事的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}等我们到了，他会把我们都杀了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And when we are, he will kill us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}什么都不会留下。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There will be nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.72,0:23:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}在这里吗？在地球上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Here? On Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.64,0:24:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们为什么要跑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Why were they running?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.90,0:24:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}因为有黑暗，\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Because there is a dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.40,0:24:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}冰冷的海水\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}cold sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}围绕着这个宇宙。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}around this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.57,0:24:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你知道该怎么做。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我看到了未来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I've seen the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.32,0:24:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}黑暗中……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The darkness…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.66,0:25:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}必须离开。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}has to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.33,0:25:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我是机长。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is your captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.38,0:25:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们目前在31000英尺的舒适高度巡航。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are currently cruising at a comfortable 31, 000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}如果你往左边看，你就会看到大峡谷。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}If you look out there to your left, just now you will see the Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.43,0:25:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那些是我们能找到的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Those are we can find!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.31,0:25:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.39,0:25:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}直飞纽约！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Direct to New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.68,0:25:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的嘴好干！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My mouth is so dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们还你清白！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And we clear your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.27,0:25:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太冷了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's so empressently cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}所有那些高个女孩都这么做！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All those tall girls doing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.90,0:25:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他不像个小婊子一样哭诉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He doesn't whine like a little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.33,0:25:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.34,0:25:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.98,0:26:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}对不起，ana\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm sorry, A.N.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}但我必须消失。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}But I've got to disappear.
