Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.06,0:31:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}正确的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.65,0:31:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你是说你不能出来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You mean you can't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我能做到。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.11,0:31:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我能做到。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.48,0:31:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}但如果我完全变形，法典会给她发送跟踪信号。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}But if I fully transform, the codex sends her a tracking signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.41,0:31:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}她会找到我们，把它从我们脊椎里扯出来，把纳尔从克林塔尔手里救出来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}She'll find us, rip it out of our spine, and free Nal from Klyntar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.20,0:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那我们要怎么摆脱这个手抄本呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So how do we get rid of this codex?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.95,0:31:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只要你和我都活着，法典就存在。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}As long as you and I both live, the codex exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.67,0:31:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}如果我们中的一个死了，法典也就没了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}If one of us should die, the codex will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.79,0:31:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这对我没用。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That's not gonna work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}或者我。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这种噬菌体速度很快。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That enophage was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.34,0:31:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}联调局要花很长时间才能把我们和\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It will take long for the feds to tie us to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.55,0:31:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们留在墨西哥的那四具无头尸体。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}those four headless bodies we left in Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.55,0:31:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们得离开这里。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We gotta get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.51,0:31:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是啊，我们得走了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah, we better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.02,0:31:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}四条腿胜过一条腿。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Four legs are better than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.23,0:31:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}跟我说实话，伙计。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Be honest with me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你觉得你能多快让那东西跑起来而不把它弄坏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}How fast do you think you can get that thing to go without killing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.61,0:31:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只有一个办法能知道。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.45,0:31:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘘，嘘。别吓着他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Shh, shh. Don't scare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.45,0:31:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}别吓着她。她是你的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't scare her. She was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.95,0:32:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不错的马，他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Nice horse, he.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.33,0:32:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不错的马，他。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Nice horse, he.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.96,0:32:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}惊喜，马，他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Surprise, horse, he!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.42,0:32:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我爱马，他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I love horse, he!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.48,0:32:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}骑我吧，牛仔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Ride me cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.32,0:32:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你这个混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You are an asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.53,0:32:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我对天发誓，等我下马，\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I swear to God, when I get off this horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.24,0:32:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要揍死你，你个混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm gonna kick your ass, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.33,0:32:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这就是马力！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Now, that's horse power!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.98,0:33:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}避风港？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Safe Haven?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.44,0:33:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不。他们不是来这里避难的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No. They're not here for a safe haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.73,0:33:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}给现在的房客换个新家怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}How about a new home to make the current tenants?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.36,0:33:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我觉得你看太多外星人入侵的电影了，雷克斯。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I think you've watched too many alien invasion movies, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.57,0:33:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}有我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.96,0:33:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们在跑。他就是这么说的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They were running. That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.21,0:33:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}别自欺欺人了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't kid yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.42,0:33:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们一直在迁徙。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They were always migrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.13,0:33:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一颗携带共生生物的流星坠落在地球上，它们都幸存了下来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}A meteor carrying symbiote life, crashes on Earth, and they all survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.22,0:33:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}巧合吗？饶了我吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Coincidence? Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.22,0:33:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.81,0:33:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们去找他们吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.85,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你太不顾一切地相信他们来这里是出于无私的原因。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're so desperate to believe that they're here for altruistic reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}让你变得危险。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Makes you dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（紧张的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[tense music]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.66,0:34:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们刚截获了空中客车打来的紧急电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We just intercepted an emergency call from an airbus out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.75,0:34:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他说，一名男子在红杉上空跳下飞机。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}of Mexico, saying a man jumped off the plane over Sequoia.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.71,0:34:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们走osmore。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We'll take the osmore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.88,0:34:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}睁大眼睛，佩恩。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eyes wide, Payne.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.21,0:34:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（尖叫）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（枪声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[gunfire]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.72,0:34:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（呻吟）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.34,0:34:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我感觉不到我的蛋蛋了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I can't feel my balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.35,0:34:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太可怕了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That was horrible.
