Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.05,0:37:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.63,0:37:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.55,0:37:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.22,0:37:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.34,0:37:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（尖叫）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.47,0:37:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咯咯笑）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[gurgling]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.89,0:37:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（水溅）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[water splashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.35,0:37:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（水溅）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[water splashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.77,0:38:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.19,0:38:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.86,0:38:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咯咯笑）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[gurgling]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.82,0:38:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咯咯笑）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[gurgling]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.32,0:38:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}发生了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.57,0:38:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}外面还有别的东西。别的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There's something else out here. Something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.91,0:38:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他说这会发生。我刚失去了三个人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He said this would happen. I just lost three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.25,0:38:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你能收集样品吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Can you collect any samples?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.62,0:38:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}样本。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.34,0:38:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（门）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[door opens]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.55,0:38:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（门关闭）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[door closes]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.72,0:38:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（风）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[wind blowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.10,0:38:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（风）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[wind blowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.39,0:38:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（风）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[wind blowing]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.06,0:38:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（小鸟喳喳叫）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[birds chirping]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.65,0:38:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们不是联邦探员。那些都是特种部队干的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Those were not Feds. Those were some special forces shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.57,0:38:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们想杀了我们。是的。是的，很好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They were trying to kill us. Yeah. Yeah, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.53,0:38:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太好了。所以现在我们有了警察。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Great. So now we have the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.70,0:38:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}美国军队和地狱来的怪物在追杀我们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The United States Army and some creature from hell hunting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.49,0:39:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}天啊，我刚看到一个外星人的脸后面喷着血。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, God, I just saw blood in a spray out of the back of an alien's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.34,0:39:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们杀了人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.43,0:39:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们没给你选择。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They didn't give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.89,0:39:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你没给我选择的机会。我找不到你。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You didn't give me a choice. I couldn't get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.31,0:39:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一年前你偷走了我的生活。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's a year ago when you stole my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.98,0:39:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们在一起一年了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We've been together for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.94,0:39:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一年太长了。在我们到达纽约之前躲好，别被杀。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}A year too long. Just stay hidden while we get to New York without getting killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咯咯笑）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[gurgling]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.87,0:39:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}【砰】\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[thud]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.20,0:39:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们需要你出来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We need you to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.38,0:39:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你说的那个东西，那个生物……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The thing you talked about, the creature…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.59,0:39:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这里的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}它杀死了一些人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It killed some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.26,0:40:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（水溅）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[water splashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.40,0:40:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（发声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.69,0:40:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喘息）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.86,0:40:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（发声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（发声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.33,0:40:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}将……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Will…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.50,0:40:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是如此美丽。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}is so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.25,0:40:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（发声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.39,0:40:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我感觉……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I sense…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.31,0:40:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我感觉到了我的旧的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I sense my old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.32,0:41:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}然而，那个诺泄密的人却不在这里。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And yet, the one Nolceaks is not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.12,0:41:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（发声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.46,0:41:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他在寻找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What does he seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.34,0:41:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}黑色的那个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The Black One.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.34,0:41:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}黑色的那个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The Black One?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.22,0:41:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}Voxymbia吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Voxymbia?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他是唯一带着法典的人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He's the only one who carries a Codex.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}结束……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The end…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.06,0:41:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是现在。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.94,0:41:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（发声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[hissing]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.40,0:41:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你需要你的西装。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You need your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.65,0:41:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}还在担心这玩意会感冒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Still worried about giving this thing a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.57,0:41:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}“毒液”是诺丝重获自由的关键。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Venom carries the key to Nolce's freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.33,0:41:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}永远不要得到它。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Never obtain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.54,0:41:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}否则你的种族将被消灭。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Or your race will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.67,0:41:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}和你……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}and you…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.34,0:41:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}和…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}and…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你……\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}you…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.09,0:41:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}每个人，一切。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}everyone, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.93,0:42:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们怎么阻止上面的东西下来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}How do we stop whatever's up there from coming down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.39,0:42:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你不能。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.73,0:42:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他比宇宙还老。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He's older than the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.31,0:42:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他指的是钥匙。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He means the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.31,0:42:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}然后一切都会结束。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Then everything will end.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.32,0:42:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们怎么才能阻止他得到它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}How do we stop him from getting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}如果共生体和宿主都活着，\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}If the symbiote and the host are alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.16,0:42:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那么古抄本还活着。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}then the Codex is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.38,0:42:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}如果其中一个死了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And if one of them dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.34,0:42:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}法典死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The Codex dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.38,0:42:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}法典死了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The Codex dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.34,0:42:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}法典死了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The Codex dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.34,0:42:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}雷克斯，你不是认真的吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Rex, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.39,0:42:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，我愿意。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, I'm game.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.80,0:42:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}毁掉法典是唯一无法获得它的方法。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Destroying the Codex is the only way it remains unobtainable.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.02,0:42:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.89,0:42:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}伙计，我在跟你说话呢。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey, buddy, I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.44,0:42:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}破坏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Destroying it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.48,0:42:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们甚至还没有触及表面。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We have barely even scratched the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.61,0:42:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的人都死了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My people are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.53,0:42:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不可战胜的力量即将到来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Something is coming that cannot be beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.61,0:43:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要马上停止这一切。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm stopping all this shit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.49,0:43:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}科学就是牺牲。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Science is sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.41,0:43:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}泰迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是认真的。听她的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Is serious. Listen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.32,0:43:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（门）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}[door opens]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.20,0:43:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你最近和家人说过话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Have you spoken to your family recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.59,0:43:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一切都还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.55,0:44:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.14,0:44:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我闻到了湿狗的味道，酱汁冒了出来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I smell wet dog and sauce emerges.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.73,0:44:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿，friendo。你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey, friendo. You okay there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.06,0:44:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不，我不好。外面蛮野的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No, I'm not okay. It's pretty wild out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.99,0:44:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我知道。你饿了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I know. You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.32,0:44:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.37,0:44:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}过来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.53,0:44:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.91,0:44:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我妻子，诺瓦·穆恩。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Well, this is my wife, Nova Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.62,0:44:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗨。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.70,0:44:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这些是我的孩子，Echo和Leaf。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And these are my kids, Echo and Leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.87,0:44:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一生都在接受治疗。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}A lifetime in therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.33,0:44:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不喜欢。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.38,0:44:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你敢。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.09,0:44:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇，你的孩子多漂亮啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Wow, how beautiful are your children?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.09,0:44:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这就是Blue。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And that's Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.68,0:44:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谁是狗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Who is a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.14,0:44:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我是马丁。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And I'm Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.77,0:44:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗨，马丁。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.60,0:44:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我是埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.60,0:44:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}很高兴认识你，埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Nice to meet you, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.52,0:44:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你也一样。快乐。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You too. Pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.65,0:44:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}请坐。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come sit, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.31,0:44:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.40,0:44:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧，谢谢。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.23,0:45:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}耶稣基督。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.86,0:45:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}所以，正确的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.24,0:45:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那盘合十礼上没死人吗，伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, so nothing died on that plate namaste, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.08,0:45:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.28,0:45:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}帮助，小胡子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Help, Tash!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.83,0:45:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，亲爱的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.75,0:45:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}艾迪，你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eddie, where are you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.04,0:45:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}纽约。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.13,0:45:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，哇。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.08,0:45:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.29,0:45:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}去纽约的路很远。我们是裸虾，伙计。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Long way to New York. We're naked shrimps, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.92,0:45:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.42,0:45:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们可以骑你去维加斯。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We could ride you out to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.34,0:45:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.84,0:45:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这些人很奇怪。我告诉你。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}These people are weird. I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.26,0:45:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那真是太好了。谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That would be so kind. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.89,0:45:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不客气。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.76,0:45:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}当然可以。生活是一场大冒险。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Of course. Life's one big adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.31,0:45:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谁不喜欢交新朋友呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Who doesn't love making new friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.77,0:45:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.02,0:45:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这家伙真是个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This guy is so one of those serial killer hitchhikers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.90,0:45:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来自我最喜欢的谋杀播客。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}from my favorite murder podcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.32,0:45:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}宝贝，现在不是时候。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Baby, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.48,0:45:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}社会服务机构还没把我们带走。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That was social services not taking us away yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.74,0:45:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}她是在开玩笑。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}She's joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.41,0:45:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不是。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.53,0:45:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}请，亲爱的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Please, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}所以我们在外星高速公路上行驶。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So we're riding the extraterrestrial highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.33,0:45:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.87,0:45:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看我。是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Watch me. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这条路通往51区。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's the road that leads to Area 51.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.46,0:46:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看看我们能不能在他们永远关闭这里之前认出外星人来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}See if we can spot as an alien before they shut the place down forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.80,0:46:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我一生的梦想。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's my lifelong dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.92,0:46:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们现在就可以给他看。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We can show him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.43,0:46:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不相信？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Not a believer?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.93,0:46:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}马丁，我该怎么说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Actually, Martin, how do I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.52,0:46:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我是。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.31,0:46:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.56,0:46:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这就是“我是我的忠实信徒”。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That's the I am I big, big believer.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.23,0:46:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你没那么大。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're not that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，有你就够了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, and you can be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.78,0:46:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}实际上，我在it部门工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And actually, I was in I.T.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.44,0:46:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.32,0:46:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.49,0:46:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}太酷了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}That's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.78,0:46:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.91,0:46:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我希望你不要失望，知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I hope you don't get disappointed, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.58,0:46:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我希望如果你真的找到了，我希望你遇到一个真正好的外星人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And I hope that if you do find one, I hope you meet a really good alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.92,0:46:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}还不错。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Not a bad one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.55,0:46:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.05,0:46:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.59,0:46:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我能分辨出黑暗力量，埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I know a dark force when I see one, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.23,0:47:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这里有点热。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's kind of hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.57,0:47:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你会习惯的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.19,0:47:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你知道空调对你的健康不好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}A.C. is really bad for your health, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.99,0:47:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.03,0:47:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}家人准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Family ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.16,0:47:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.49,0:47:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}客人准备好了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Guest ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.99,0:47:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}让我们震撼这个露营车。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's rock this camper.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.58,0:47:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}地面控制呼叫汤姆少校。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Ground control to Major Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.67,0:47:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，我喜欢合唱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, I love a sing-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.50,0:47:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}地面控制呼叫汤姆少校。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Ground control to Major Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}朝我脸上开枪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Shoot me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.84,0:47:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}吃蛋白质药片，戴上头盔。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Take your protein pills and put your helmet on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.60,0:47:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.76,0:47:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我的果酱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is my jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.52,0:47:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}九个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.31,0:47:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}八个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.89,0:47:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}七。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.35,0:47:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}六。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.69,0:47:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}启动复合发动机。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Commencing compound engines on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.02,0:47:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}三。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.78,0:47:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}两个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.32,0:47:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看看吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.07,0:47:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一个。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.49,0:47:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}让上帝的爱在椽子上。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And make God's love be in the rafter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.37,0:47:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧，艾迪，跟着唱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on, Eddie, sing along.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.49,0:47:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我很好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.37,0:47:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你在这个世界上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Are you in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.66,0:47:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不。就当这是观光巴士吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No. Just think of this as the tour bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.50,0:48:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们是乐队，你可以是粉丝。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're the band, and you could be the groupie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.21,0:48:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.21,0:48:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不要太死板。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't be square.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.46,0:48:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}别让我开口。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't get me started.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.59,0:48:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是汤姆少校的地面控制中心。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is Major Tom's ground control.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.34,0:48:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要进门了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm stepping through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.34,0:48:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我正以最奇特的方式漂浮着。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And I'm floating in the most peculiar way.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.35,0:48:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}小心点，今天的星星看起来很不一样。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Care up, and the stars look very different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.31,0:48:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.98,0:48:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}因为他是我锡罐里的城市。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}For he is my city in a tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.86,0:48:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可以做罐头！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Can make a tin!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.11,0:48:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}远在世界之上。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Far above the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.07,0:48:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}就像洗澡一样。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Like a bath, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.82,0:48:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}地球是蓝色的，我什么也做不了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Planet Earth is blue, and there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.66,0:48:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.83,0:48:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}地面控制呼叫汤姆少校。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is ground control to Major Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.79,0:48:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}有时候我想，如果我们过这样的生活，我们会更幸福。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Sometimes I think we would have been happier with a life like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.67,0:48:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}球员们也想知道，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And the players want to know, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.51,0:48:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.01,0:48:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}现在有迹象表明几天内会有现金。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Now the signs lead to cash for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.81,0:49:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的爱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My love.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.56,0:49:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}汤姆少校呼叫地面控制中心。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is Major Tom to ground control.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要进门了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm stepping through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.32,0:49:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我正以一种最奇特的方式漂浮着。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And I'm floating in a most peculiar way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.36,0:49:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}今天的星星看起来很不一样。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And the stars look very different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.29,0:49:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}因为他是我锡罐里的城市。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}For he is my city in a tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.25,0:49:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}远在世界之上。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Far above the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.11,0:50:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（处理）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(crunching)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.41,0:50:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你喜欢巧克力吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You like chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.75,0:50:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘘，他们不让我们吃糖。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Shh, they don't let us eat sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.54,0:50:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.21,0:50:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我有个朋友很喜欢巧克力。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I have a friend who loves chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.42,0:50:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.76,0:50:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你真是太好了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我不想看到洋葱。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I don't wanna see an onion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.43,0:50:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你不？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.98,0:50:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可怕的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.36,0:50:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay.
