Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.83,1:02:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你可以跳舞。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You can dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.70,1:02:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你可以跳舞。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You can dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.25,1:02:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}享受人生中最美好的时光。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Having the time of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.88,1:02:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你们俩什么时候练的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}When did you two practice this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.76,1:02:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（叹息）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(sighs)
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.85,1:03:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（欢快的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(upbeat music)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.82,1:03:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}该死的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.04,1:03:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我告诉过你会发生这种事。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I told you this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.87,1:03:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（尖叫）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(screams)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.79,1:03:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}别慌，她看不到库德克斯。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't panic, she can't see the kudex.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.33,1:03:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.88,1:03:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇，好丑。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Wow, so ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.34,1:03:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}呆在你能呆的地方。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Stay where you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.47,1:03:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}她看不见她要找的东西。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}She can't see the thing she's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.01,1:03:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（尖叫）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(screams)
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.31,1:03:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.07,1:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不管怎样你都活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You live anyhow!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.41,1:03:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我选择。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I choose.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.00,1:04:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（悬疑的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(suspenseful music)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.73,1:04:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.56,1:04:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（笑）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(laughs)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.61,1:04:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}51区。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Area 51.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.15,1:04:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.95,1:04:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.82,1:04:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们成功了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.50,1:04:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你终于看到了，丹。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You finally got to see it, Den.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.50,1:04:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这挺酷的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's kind of cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.75,1:04:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嗯。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.63,1:04:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我猜。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.00,1:04:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.38,1:04:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}叶子。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Leaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.26,1:04:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}亲爱的，你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Where you going, hon?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.55,1:04:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}看看能不能找点更酷的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Well, let's see if we can't find us something cooler.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.76,1:04:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.72,1:05:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧，伙计们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.81,1:05:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好的，宝贝。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Okay, babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.81,1:05:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一生的梦想。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Life's long dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.81,1:05:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好了，快，快，快，快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All right, go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.06,1:05:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我闻起来像外星人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I smell alien.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.98,1:05:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（笑）（悬疑的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(laughs) (suspenseful music)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.24,1:05:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}没有宿主，他的情况正在恶化。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He's deteriorating without his host.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.91,1:05:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}可怜的东西。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.03,1:05:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}把他和其他人放在下面。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Put him below with the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.20,1:05:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我在那里更安全。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm safer there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.91,1:05:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（悬疑的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(suspenseful music)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.90,1:05:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（普通员工）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(grunts)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.70,1:05:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}下来，下来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Down, down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.16,1:05:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}加油！加油。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.21,1:06:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.50,1:06:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿，嘿。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.71,1:06:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我想我们在上面会看得更清楚。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I think we're gonna get a better view from up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}跟我来，伙计们，来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Follow me, guys, and come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.26,1:06:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这太令人兴奋了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.31,1:06:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}真不敢相信我们来了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I can't believe we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.57,1:06:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.16,1:06:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.45,1:06:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，好吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.20,1:06:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.34,1:06:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（悬疑的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(suspenseful music)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.63,1:06:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}都坏了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's all broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.76,1:07:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}很伤心。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}So sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.36,1:07:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，老兄。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.99,1:07:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿，哥们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.24,1:07:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，不。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.37,1:07:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.75,1:07:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不，你一天能有几个小时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh, no, how many hours can you have in one day?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.71,1:07:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}埃迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.72,1:07:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}喂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.56,1:07:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他们这样对我。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}They did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.89,1:07:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（悬疑的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(suspenseful music)
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.10,1:07:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}摩根？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Morgan?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.98,1:07:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.02,1:07:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你还活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.65,1:07:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.45,1:08:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们被追杀了，艾迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're being hunted, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.91,1:08:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你有他需要的东西。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You have what he needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.95,1:08:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}保护法典不受黑暗之手的侵害。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Protect the Codex from dark hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.58,1:08:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}共生大军在这里等着。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}A symbiote army waits here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.54,1:08:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}免费的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Free them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.34,1:08:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}保护，埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Protected, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.47,1:08:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}现在必须锁起来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Now must stay locked away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.93,1:08:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}艾迪，我是佩恩医生。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eddie, I'm Dr. Payne.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.85,1:08:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的朋友呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Where's my friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.90,1:08:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他现在很安全。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He's safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.69,1:08:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}伟大的新闻。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Great news.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.78,1:08:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们都做完了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We're all done here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.11,1:08:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这一切都不是你能控制的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}All of this is out of your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.45,1:08:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是我的实验室。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}This is my lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.37,1:08:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不不不，不是你的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No, no, no, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.66,1:08:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你只是在这里工作。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You just work here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.78,1:08:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}或者你做了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Or you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.83,1:08:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你，圣诞老人，你要回家了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You, Christmas, you're going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.20,1:08:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那他们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}And what about them?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.62,1:08:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你听到上面说的了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You heard what it said.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.83,1:08:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}只有他们都活着，法典才会存在。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The Codex only exists if they're both alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.88,1:08:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}是的，我们没事，我们没事。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Yeah, we're good, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.25,1:08:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你杀了我的人。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You killed one of my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.84,1:09:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要亲自回报你。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm returning the favor personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.42,1:09:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}请把佩恩博士送出去。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Please escort Dr. Payne out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.34,1:09:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}圣诞节，该走了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Christmas, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.13,1:09:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.80,1:09:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.65,1:09:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}大错误。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.81,1:09:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(grunting)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.02,1:09:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.44,1:09:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.78,1:09:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.74,1:09:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.29,1:09:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.24,1:09:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）（叫喊）（枪声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling) (yelling) (gunshots)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.25,1:09:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.08,1:09:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（枪声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(gunshots)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.67,1:09:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}毒液，快跑，快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Venom, run, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.80,1:09:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.80,1:09:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}释放共生体。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Release the symbiotes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.60,1:09:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.44,1:10:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.99,1:10:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（枪声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(gunshots)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.28,1:10:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.41,1:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（的）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(grunting)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.70,1:10:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.33,1:10:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.25,1:10:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（枪声）（喊叫声）（喊叫声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(gunshots) (yelling) (yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.38,1:10:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}吉姆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Jim!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.01,1:10:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.47,1:10:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}拒绝她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Turn her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.55,1:10:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}得到她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Get her!
