Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.52,1:10:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}走吧，孩子。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Let's go, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.73,1:10:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}拿下她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Take her down!
