Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.40,1:10:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.44,1:10:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要摔倒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm gonna fall down!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.41,1:10:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（喊）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(yelling)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.25,1:10:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}的帮助！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Help!
