Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.68,1:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.43,1:11:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.73,1:11:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}离开她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Leave her!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.10,1:11:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}离开她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Leave her!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.73,1:11:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}把大麻拿出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Get the clonax outta here!
