Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.54,1:11:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你带我们出去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You break us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.21,1:11:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.72,1:11:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这里没有外星人，孩子们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There's no aliens here, kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.68,1:11:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}最好的鞋子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Best shoes ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.64,1:11:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.77,1:11:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.14,1:11:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（枪声）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(gunshots)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.06,1:12:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们得走了，快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We gotta go, move it!
