Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.99,1:12:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们要走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We are leaving!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.45,1:12:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.08,1:12:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}动，动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.04,1:12:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}没事的，没事的，孩子们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's all right, it's all right, kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.34,1:12:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}外星人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Aliens!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.51,1:12:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}外星人入侵！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Alien invasion!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.51,1:12:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}外星人攻击！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Alien attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.52,1:12:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}草泥马！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.86,1:12:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.19,1:12:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你们两个，出去，上帝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You two, get out, Lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.36,1:12:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿，等等，先生，抓住我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey, wait, sir, hold me!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.11,1:12:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你在空中飘飘欲仙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're high on the airborne!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.32,1:12:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}快，快，快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.36,1:12:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}在港湾的海湾里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}In the harbor's gulf!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.41,1:12:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我们得把手抄本弄得越远越好。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}We got to get the codex as far away as possible.
