Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.79,1:13:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}埃迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.54,1:13:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.00,1:13:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.96,1:13:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}艾迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}艾迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.92,1:13:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}哦，不，埃迪，埃迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Oh no, Eddie, Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.30,1:13:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}马丁，我是家人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Martin, I'm family!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.47,1:13:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不能在这儿，马丁。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Can't be here, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.76,1:13:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}黑暗力量，伙计！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Dark forces, man!
