Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.87,1:13:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}外星人是真的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Aliens are real.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.41,1:13:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我在这个世界上最好的朋友就是一只。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My best friend in the whole world is one.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.33,1:13:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}他会带你出去的，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}He's gonna get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.29,1:13:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不要害怕。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Don't be scared.
