Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.34,1:13:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}这是为了巧克力。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}It's for the chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.30,1:13:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不客气。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.15,1:14:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（咆哮）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(growling)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.86,1:14:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}No!
