Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.42,1:14:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}坚持住，卡莉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hold on, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.46,1:14:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}坚持住，卡莉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hold on, Kari!
