Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.87,1:15:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我的宝贝，我的宝贝。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}My baby, my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.75,1:15:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你，埃迪。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you, Eddie.
