Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.85,1:15:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.90,1:15:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}来吧。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.53,1:15:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}打电话，把法典拿来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Call, bring me that Codex.
