Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.30,1:16:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}她救了我们。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}She saved us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.38,1:16:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我没看到有什么能分散他们的注意力。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I saw no one thing that's gonna distract them.
