Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.98,1:16:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}Kari，Kari！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Kari, Kari!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.73,1:16:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我要把他们抓起来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I'm gonna round them up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.06,1:16:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}让直升机跟我来。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Have the chopper follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.98,1:16:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}快，快，快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.15,1:17:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Go!
