Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.54,1:17:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}Kari，亲爱的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Kari, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.91,1:17:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}谢谢你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.87,1:17:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}外星人吸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Aliens suck!
