Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.44,1:18:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}把它们点着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Light them up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.23,1:18:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}收到。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.04,1:18:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}扭矩消除。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Torque eliminate.
