Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.19,1:32:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}把我推到超速，这是多么可爱的一种方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Push me into overdrive what a lovely way to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.11,1:33:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}如果你陪在我身边，我就会一路顺风\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}If you're with me by my side I'm in for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.45,1:33:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}（欢快的音乐）\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}(upbeat music)
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.74,1:33:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}无处可逃，毒液不等人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}There's no running no escape all the venom never waits.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.46,1:33:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}一旦你觉得它刺痛了你的血管，就太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Once you feel it hits your veins it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.96,1:33:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你离开以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}You're gone.
