Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.35,1:34:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}你的冠军倒下了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Your champion has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.65,1:35:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}行星将是我的。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The planets will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.03,1:35:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}黑衣国王醒了。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}The king in black is awake.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.07,1:35:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}我会杀了你的世界。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}I will kill your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.28,1:35:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\be1}每个人都会被烧死。\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\be1}Everyone will burn.
